    "doc_text": "XIN_ENG_20061115.0185\n\nBAGHDAD, Nov. 15 , 2006 (Xinhua)\n\ntoll rises to three\n\n\n\n\nThe death toll rose to three and 12 others were wounded when a suicide car bomb struck a funeral ceremony in a southern Baghdad district on Wednesday, an Interior Ministry source told Xinhua.\n\n\"A suicide bomber drove his explosive-laden car into mourners of a funeral in the al-Saha neighborhood, killing three people and wounding 12 others,\" the source said on condition of anonymity.\n\nEarlier, local police said that two people were killed and 12 others wounded.\n\nIn another incident, a car bomb parking near the Gailani gas station in Bab al-Sharji area exploded Wednesday, killing eight people and wounding 32 others.",
